   "message": "fix: reject stale servers in local preflight\n\nValidate a free loopback port before sandbox setup and require a flushed, nonempty installer log plus the exact running wrapper around health probes. Restrict cleanup to the tracked child job instead of signaling an unknown listener by port.\n\nAdd offline regression coverage to the installer suite and document fail-closed cleanup limits.\n\nCloses #38\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>",
